# Luanti 5.17: it comes without games, so the games in ../games.lock (luanti.org's
# gallery and more from ContentDB) are unpacked into its
# games folder, Android/data/net.minetest.minetest/files/Minetest/games (its user
# folder is getExternalFilesDir + "Minetest"; its own first-start unpacking only adds
# builtin, client and textures there). Each zip once, so a game the user deletes stays
# deleted. See ../../README.md, "First-start settings".
package net.minetest.minetest
extzip minetest_game.zip Minetest/games
extzip glitch.zip Minetest/games
extzip backroomtest.zip Minetest/games
extzip mineclonia.zip Minetest/games
extzip voxelgarden.zip Minetest/games
extzip minetest_classic.zip Minetest/games
extzip nodecore.zip Minetest/games
extzip pmb_core.zip Minetest/games
extzip tutorial.zip Minetest/games
extzip alter.zip Minetest/games
extzip klots.zip Minetest/games
extzip sokoblox_game.zip Minetest/games
extzip cow.zip Minetest/games
extzip blockbomber.zip Minetest/games
extzip prang.zip Minetest/games
